      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little He: I’m comforting you right now!"
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "simplified": "丽丽：这也“拉倒”、那也“拉倒”……这就是你的安慰方式吗？",
      "traditional": "麗麗：這也“拉倒”、那也“拉倒”……這就是你的安慰方式嗎？",
      "pinyin": "lì lì zhè yě lā dǎo nà yě lā dǎo zhè jiù shì nǐ de ān wèi fāng shì ma",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Lili: “Never mind” this, “never mind” that… This is your way of comforting me?"
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "simplified": "小何：你这也不要，那也不要……你没有给我安慰你的机会啊！",
      "traditional": "小何：你這也不要，那也不要……你沒有給我安慰你的機會啊！",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo hé nǐ zhè yě bú yào nà yě bú yào nǐ méi yǒu gěi wǒ ān wèi nǐ de jī huì a",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 27,
      "simplified": "",
      "traditional": "",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little He: You won’t do this, won’t do that… You’re not giving me the opportunity to comfort you!"
    }
